ink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-body text-fg-secondary","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold text-fg","children":"Staff augmentation"}]," — senior engineers from $50 USD an hour."]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-8 max-w-[70ch] font-mono text-body text-fg-secondary","children":"Every engagement starts with a fixed-scope discovery, so you get a real number before you commit. Senior nearshore talent runs a fraction of a US dev shop, and you own every line of code and the IP."}]]}]
21:["$","section",null,{"id":"software-company","data-reveal":true,"className":"scroll-mt-24 border-b-hairline-soft py-20","children":["$undefined",["$","h2",null,{"className":"max-w-[30ch] font-display text-display-l font-extrabold text-fg [text-wrap:balance]","children":"Why teams pick us as their custom software development company"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-8 max-w-[70ch] font-mono text-body text-fg-secondary","children":"Most custom software development companies bill offshore juniors by the hour and keep the code in a black box. We do the opposite. Senior nearshore engineers work in your time zone, product thinking keeps the build aimed at outcomes instead of runaway scope, and the source code, IP, and data are yours from day one. From a fast MVP to enterprise software development, you get one accountable partner for the build, the cloud it runs on, and the data it produces."}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
22:["$","section",null,{"id":"cases","data-reveal":true,"className":"scroll-mt-24 border-b-hairline-soft py-20","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-label uppercase text-fg-muted [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label)]","children":"Proof"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-4 max-w-[24ch] font-display text-display-l font-extrabold text-fg [text-wrap:balance]","children":"Custom software we've delivered"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-10 border-t-hairline-soft","children":[["$","li","delivery-evidence-automation-google-workspace",{"children":"$L3a"}],["$","li","technical-seo-b2b-hardware-catalog-laravel",{"children":"$L3b"}]]}]]}]
23:["$","$L3c",null,{"faqs":[{"question":"What is custom software development?","answer":"Custom software development is building software tailored to your business instead of using off-the-shelf tools. That includes web and mobile apps, internal platforms, integrations, and SaaS products — designed around your workflows, integrated with your systems, and owned by you. It removes the friction generic software can't."},{"question":"Custom software vs off-the-shelf — which should I choose?","answer":"Off-the-shelf is faster and cheaper to start, but you adapt to it and pay forever. Custom software fits your exact workflow, integrates with what you have, and becomes an asset you own. Rule of thumb: buy for commodity needs, build when the software IS your advantage or no tool fits. We'll tell you honestly which is right."},{"question":"How much does custom software development cost?","answer":"It depends on scope and complexity. Our software development services are priced three ways: a fixed-scope project (defined price up front, after a discovery phase), a dedicated nearshore team (monthly per engineer), or staff augmentation from $50 USD/hour. Senior nearshore talent costs a fraction of a US dev shop — and you own everything we build."},{"question":"How long does it take to build?","answer":"A focused MVP can ship in weeks; a full platform takes a few months and then keeps evolving. We ship in increments, so you see working software every sprint instead of waiting months for a big-bang launch. The discovery phase gives you a realistic timeline before we start."},{"question":"Do I own the code and IP?","answer":"Yes — always. The source code, IP, and data are yours from day one. No lock-in, no black box. You can host it, extend it with another team, or take it anywhere. We build it for you, not to trap you."},{"question":"Do you build for my industry (healthcare, fintech, logistics)?","answer":"Yes. We have domain expertise across healthcare (HIPAA-aware), fintech and financial, logistics and supply chain, retail and ecommerce, insurance, ERP, and more. Industry-aware software respects the rules and realities of your sector — not a generic template."},{"question":"How do I choose a custom software development company?","answer":"Look for senior engineers who stay on your project (not a junior carousel), a partner who hands you the source code and IP with no lock-in, and real domain experience in your industry. Time-zone overlap matters too. A nearshore custom software development company collaborates in your hours and ships faster than an offshore shop. We check every box, with 1,000+ projects across 17 countries in 15+ years."},{"question":"What do your custom software development services include?","answer":"End to end: discovery and scoping, UX/UI and architecture design, full-stack build across web, mobile, and SaaS, APIs and integrations, AI features, and ongoing evolution after launch. Our custom software development services also cover the cloud, data, and analytics work most teams need, so you get one senior nearshore partner instead of five vendors."},{"question":"Is bespoke software development the same as custom software?","answer":"Yes. Bespoke software development is just another name for custom software: an application built specifically for your business instead of bought off the shelf. Whichever term you use, the result with us is the same. Software shaped to your exact workflow, with the source code and IP owned by you."}],"id":"faq","title":"What teams ask before building custom software.","fill":true}]
24:["$","section",null,{"data-reveal":true,"className":"border-b-hairline-soft py-20","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-label uppercase text-fg-muted [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label)]","children":"Related services"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-4 font-display text-display-m font-bold text-fg","children":"Often paired with custom software"}],["$","ul",null,{"data-reveal-stagger":true,"className":"mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4","children":[["$","li","nearshore-software-development",{"children":"$L3d"}],["$","li","web-development",{"children":"$L3e"}],["$","li","digital-transformation",{"children":"$L3f"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-20 font-mono text-label uppercase text-fg-muted [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label)]","children":"Learn more"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-4 font-display text-display-m font-bold text-fg","children":"From the blog"}],["$","$L40",null,{"posts":[{"title":"Build vs buy software: the real trade-offs","slug":"build-vs-buy-software","category":"Guide","excerpt":"Build vs buy software is a decision framework, not a coin flip: build when the software is your edge, buy when the need is generic. Here's the real build vs buy decision — the trade-offs, the costs, and how to know which side you're on.","readMin":6,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/csw-build.webp","imageAlt":"A developer writing code, illustrating the build vs buy software decision"},{"title":"Custom Healthcare Software Development (HIPAA-aware)","slug":"custom-healthcare-software","category":"Guide","excerpt":"Custom healthcare software is software built specifically for a provider, payer, or health-tech company instead of bought off-the-shelf — designed around real clinical workflows and built HIPAA-aware from day one. Here's what it covers, what it costs, and how nearshore teams build it.","readMin":6,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/healthcare-sw.webp","imageAlt":"A doctor using a healthcare software dashboard, illustrating custom healthcare software development"},{"title":"Custom software development cost (2026)","slug":"custom-software-development-cost","category":"Guide","excerpt":"What does custom software development cost in 2026? A typical project runs $50K-$250K+, but the real number depends on scope, complexity, and where your team sits. Here's how custom software development cost actually breaks down — and how nearshore changes the math.","readMin":6,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/csw-cost.webp","imageAlt":"A developer with code on screen and coins, representing custom software development cost"},{"title":"The custom software development process, step by step","slug":"custom-software-development-process","category":"Guide","excerpt":"The custom software development process is the path from raw idea to live, maintained product — usually discovery, design, build, test, deploy, and evolve. Here's how each phase works, who does what, and where most custom builds quietly go wrong.","readMin":6,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/csw-process.webp","imageAlt":"A software team in a sprint planning session, the custom software development process"},{"title":"Custom software vs off-the-shelf: which is right?","slug":"custom-software-vs-off-the-shelf","category":"Guide","excerpt":"Custom software vs off-the-shelf comes down to fit versus speed: a built-to-spec system that bends to your workflow, or a ready-made product you adopt today. Here's how to choose, what each costs, and when building wins.","readMin":5,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/csw-vs-offshelf.webp","imageAlt":"Developers building custom code, illustrating custom software vs off-the-shelf"},{"title":"How to choose a custom software development company","slug":"how-to-choose-a-custom-software-company","category":"Guide","excerpt":"Choosing a custom software development company comes down to fit, not headline rates. Here's how to evaluate vendors on engineering seniority, IP ownership, process, time-zone overlap, and total cost — plus a scoring checklist you can run on any shortlist.","readMin":7,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/csw-choose.webp","imageAlt":"A client shaking hands with a development team, how to choose a custom software development company"}],"className":"mt-8"}]]}]
